WEBVTT

00:00:59.891 --> 00:01:01.193
Dhe, nese "Nga vjen?"

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:02.838
nenkupton "Ku i paguan taksat?"

00:01:02.838 --> 00:01:05.432
"Ku shkon te doktori dhe dentisti?"

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.795
atehere jam nga Shtetet e Bashkuara,

00:01:07.795 --> 00:01:10.363
ku jetoj prej 48 vitesh tashme,

00:01:10.363 --> 00:01:12.451
qe kur isha kalama.

00:01:12.451 --> 00:01:14.159
Perjashtuar, ato shume vite,

00:01:14.159 --> 00:01:16.428
kur me eshte dashur te mbaj me vete kete karten e vogel roze

00:01:16.428 --> 00:01:18.351
me shirita jeshile qe pershkruajne fytyren time

00:01:18.351 --> 00:01:21.202
qe me identifikonte si rezident i huaj.

00:01:21.202 --> 00:01:25.464
Ne fakt, sa me shume qendroj ketu aq me teper i huaj ndihem.

00:01:25.464 --> 00:01:27.651
(Te qeshura)

00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:29.238
Dhe, nese "Nga vjen?"

00:01:29.238 --> 00:01:32.004
do te thote "Cili vend i ka rrenjet me te thella brenda teje